# Cookie Bars

{ rating="2" image="cookie_bars.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1 pkg [cake mix]{ ing="cake-mix" }
- [ ] 2 [eggs]{ ing="egg" }
- [ ] 5 Tbsp [melted butter]{ ing="melted-butter" }
- [ ] 1 bag [chocolate chips]{ ing="chocolate-chips" }

## Recipe

1. [Mix]{ ing="cake-mix" } all together in a 9x13 pan and bake at 350 for 20-25 minutes
